\newlabel{fig:cog_arch}{{1}{3}{\textbf {MPCS Dual-Process Cognitive Architecture \& Semantic Foraging Loop.} Sensory afferent inputs are bound into Z-number tuples and routed simultaneously to System~1 fast subsymbolic gating (dlCBF + HyST, $<3\,\mu \text {s}$) and the Damasio Somatic Marker engine. High-novelty or ambiguous inputs trigger System~2 TIDE spreading activation, which balances patch exploitation (Confident Persona) against cross-patch exploratory traversal}{figure.1}{}}
